 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Range</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">35 km<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground"> (22 miles)</span></dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Top Speed</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">0–12 km/h<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground"> (7.5 mph)</span></dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Max Stair Slope</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">40°</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Weight (no battery)</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">115.8 kg<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground"> (255 lbs)</span></dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Legrest Adjustment</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Electric (Pro exclusive)</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Battery</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">25.2V<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground"> 25.6Ah × 2</span></dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Charge Time</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">6.5 hours × 2</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Protection</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-medium text-foreground">IPX5<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground"> Water Resistant</span></dd></div></dl><div class="mt-10"><h3 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Dimensions</h3><dl class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Compact transport size</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-foreground">1185 × 685 × 617 mm</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Operating size</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-foreground">1210 × 685 × 1550 mm</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Lifting / seat range</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-foreground">315–700 mm</dd></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Recline Angle</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-foreground">90°–121°</dd></div></dl></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-included" id="_R_hl_-panel-included" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO X12 Pro All-Terrain Mobility Robot</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>2× 25.2V 25.6Ah Lithium Battery Packs</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Battery Charger</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Joystick Controller</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Wireless Key</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>User Manual</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Tool Kit</li></ul></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-delivery" id="_R_hl_-panel-delivery" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground"><p>Free UK mainland delivery on all XSTO wheelchairs. The X12 is in stock, with an estimated delivery of 10 days.</p><p>Warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts, and 1 year on the battery. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor.</p></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a href="/pages/returns" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Read our returns policy</a> · <a href="/pages/warranty" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Warranty information</a></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-faq" id="_R_hl_-panel-faq" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft"><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the X12 really climb stairs?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The X12 uses caterpillar track technology to safely climb and descend stairs at angles up to 40°. The AI-powered system automatically adjusts speed and balance on each step, and a companion can monitor progress via the app.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How does the X12 handle different terrains?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 is a true all-terrain machine. Beyond stairs, it handles grass, gravel, sand, mud, snow, and steep hills. The dual-track system provides exceptional traction and stability on surfaces that would stop a conventional chair.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the X12&#x27;s battery range?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 comes with dual 25.2V 25.6Ah batteries providing up to 35 km (22 miles) of range on a single charge. Both batteries charge simultaneously, and the system can operate on a single battery if needed.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How much does the X12 weigh?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 weighs 112.8 kg without battery (about 115.8 kg as X12 Pro with the electric elevating leg rest). It is not designed to be lifted like the M4 series — it is built for all-terrain performance and stair-climbing capability. It can be transported in a suitable vehicle with a ramp or hoist.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Is the X12 available to buy now?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The X12 is in stock now, with an estimated delivery of 10 days. Free UK mainland delivery is included.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What&#x27;s included in the box with the X12?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The X12 comes with the robot, 2× batteries, charger, joystick controller, wireless key, user manual, and tool kit. The X12 is app-controlled, so no physical remote control is included.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the difference between X12 and X12 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">They are the same X12 chair. X12 Pro adds an electric elevating leg rest; the standard X12 does not. Both share the same 136 kg capacity, 40° stair capability, dual batteries, and 35 km range. Choose X12 or X12 Pro when you add the chair to your cart, then add any accessories.</p></details></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-videos" id="_R_hl_-panel-videos" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-secondary shadow-soft"><iframe loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen="" class="size-full border-0 object-contain" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4KFMBL5jX20" title="Watch the X12 in Action"></iframe></div><p class="font-medium text-foreground">Watch the X12 in Action</p></div></div></div></div></section>{% render 'mr-product-related', current: product.handle %}</div><section aria-labelledby="product-app-download-heading" class="border-t border-border/40 bg-gradient-to-b from-background to-cream/40 pb-12 pt-14 md:pb-16 md:pt-20"><div class="xsto-container"><div class="grid items-end gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl" id="product-app-download-heading">Download the XSTO App</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted-foreground md:text-lg">Activate intelligent control — monitor battery, mileage, and remotely drive your chair.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 lg:justify-start"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-background p-3 shadow-medium"><img alt="Download the iOS app" class="size-32 object-contain md:size-36" height="140" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'mr-xsto-app-ios-qr.png' | asset_url }}" width="140"/></div><span class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Download the iOS app</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">